  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\n__\n \n• Consider C as '÷'\n \n• Consider D as '×'\n\nGiven,\n\n \n• 31 C 19 D 57 = 93\n\n⇒ **31** ÷ 19__ × 57 = 93\n\n⇒ __**{31 over 19}** × 57__ = 93\n\n⇒ __**31× 3**__ = 93\n\n⇒ 93 = 93 (LHS = RHS)\n\nAnd,\n\n__\n \n• 52 C 13 D 5 = 20\n\n⇒ **52** ÷ 13__ × 5= 20\n\n⇒ __4 × 5__ = 20\n\n⇒ 20 = 20 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSimilarly,\n\n__\n \n• 98 C 14 D 11 = ?\n\n⇒ **9**8 ÷ 14__ × 11 = ?\n\n⇒ __7 × 11__ = ?\n\n⇒ 77 = ?\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"77\".",
